@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam DefaultFontName "Salesforce Sans","Helvetica Neue","Arial","Sans-Serif"
skinparam DefaultFontSize 14
skinparam DefaultFontColor #3E3E3C
skinparam LineColor #D0D5DA
skinparam ArrowColor #0176D3
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F3F2F2
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D0D5DA
skinparam NoteFontColor #3E3E3C
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #D0D5DA
skinparam ComponentFontColor #3E3E3C
left to right direction
title Component Architecture (Apex, LWC, Flow)

skinparam linetype ortho

skinparam componentBackgroundColor<<LWC>> #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBorderColor<<LWC>> #D0D5DA
skinparam componentBackgroundColor<<Apex>> #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBorderColor<<Apex>> #D0D5DA
skinparam componentBackgroundColor<<Flow>> #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBorderColor<<Flow>> #D0D5DA
skinparam componentBackgroundColor<<Trigger>> #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBorderColor<<Trigger>> #D0D5DA

component "LWC: successionContactCadence" as L1 <<LWC>>
component "LWC: caseHierarchyViewer" as L2 <<LWC>>
component "LWC: successionPublicForm" as L3 <<LWC>>
component "Apex: ContactCadenceController" as A1 <<Apex>>
component "Apex: CaseHierarchyController" as A2 <<Apex>>
component "Apex: SuccessionPublicFormController" as A3 <<Apex>>
component "Trigger: SuccessionCaseTrigger" as T1 <<Trigger>>
component "Apex: SuccessionTaskGenerator" as A4 <<Apex>>
component "Flow: Case_Status_Coordination" as F1 <<Flow>>
database "Case/Task/FA/FAR" as DB

L1 --> A1
L2 --> A2
L3 --> A3
T1 --> A4
A4 --> DB : create pathway tasks
F1 --> DB : status updates
A1 --> DB
A2 --> DB
A3 --> DB

legend right
Stereotypes
- <<LWC>> Lightning Web Component (UI)
- <<Apex>> Apex Controller/Service
- <<Flow>> Flow Automation
- <<Trigger>> Apex Trigger
endlegend

note bottom
All Apex controllers execute WITH USER_MODE to enforce FLS
end note
@enduml
